        ["All crafting materials looted while the run is active count.\n\nYour material totals update automatically while the run is active.\n\nChoose a survey type, a material name and a quantity above to set a goal."]="All crafting materials looted while the run is active count.\n\nYour material totals update automatically while the run is active.\n\nChoose a survey type, a material name and a quantity above to set a goal.",
        ["Item ID\tMaterial\tQuantity\tRegular-sized\tSurvey/Large\tOther\tUnit estimate\tTotal estimate"]="Item ID\tMaterial\tQuantity\tRegular-sized\tSurvey/Large\tOther\tUnit estimate\tTotal estimate",
        ["HELP"]="SURVEY SIDEKICK — HOW TO USE\n\nSTART A GATHERING RUN\n1. Type /surveys to open the window.\n2. Open Current Run and click Start / Resume.\n3. Gather materials. Your quantities and timer update automatically.\n4. Click Pause for a break; Start / Resume continues the same run.\n5. Click Finish Run to save your results in The Hoard Report.\n\nSET A COLLECTION GOAL\nIn Current Run, choose a Survey Type, choose a material by name, enter the quantity you want, then click Set Goal. Progress includes that material already gathered during the current run. You will get a message and sound when you reach the target.\n\nFIND AND TRAVEL TO SURVEYS\nPut your surveys in your backpack. In My Surveys, select a survey from the list. Survey Type beside The Hoard Report cycles through the crafting types.\n• Map icon: open the survey map and place a waypoint.\n• Wayshrine icon: travel to its closest unlocked wayshrine. Normal travel costs apply.\n• Gold coin: preview the destination and recall quote without traveling.\n• Circular arrow: refresh the list and duplicate counts. The list also updates automatically.\nLibTreasure is needed for survey locations and travel. Bank counts are refreshed while your bank is open.\n\nREAD AND COPY YOUR RESULTS\nFinish a run, then open The Hoard Report. Newer / Older browse saved runs. Copy Summary opens a short message to copy; Export Details opens the full list. Click the text and use Ctrl+A, then Ctrl+C. Nothing is sent automatically. Price estimates appear when price data is available.\n\nWINDOW CONTROLS\nClick Colors in the title bar or type /surveys colors to choose a preset, background, title bar and border colors. Changes apply instantly and save for this character. Reset Colors restores Plum.\nMinus minimizes to a live tracker bar. Plus restores the full window. Gathering keeps counting while minimized. Close hides the window; /surveys reopens it. Its position and open/closed state are remembered. Hover over buttons for their descriptions.\nUse /surveys scale 70 for a smaller window, or /surveys scale 80 for the default.\n\nCOMMANDS\n/surveys — open or close\n/surveys start — start or resume\n/surveys pause — pause\n/surveys finish — save the run\n/surveys goal — open collection setup\n/surveyport — travel to the selected survey\n/surveys help — show this guide\n\nAfter /reloadui or login, click Start / Resume to continue a saved run.",
